From 2a53e140ff146e8322043394c722f293e875a6f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: diamondStar35 <ramymaherali55@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:48:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: schedule automatic audio playlist cross-fades

Add audio-crossfade-duration and audio-crossfade-curve options. Reserve PCM lookahead, prefetch queued successors and schedule transitions from the final decoded window. Apply playlist loop and shuffle policy once and report natural EOF. Preserve outgoing tails when incoming files are short and invalidate stale successor prefetches.
